      "role": "user",
      "content": "seriously though, the pinata thing is super unhelpful lol. i'm trying to figure out if i need to call an emergency plumber tonight or if i can wait until the weekend. \n\nif it is just sediment moving around, why would it be so rhythmic? like, why wouldn't it be random? it's almost like a deliberate beat. is there any other mechanical thing that could cause a steady, pulsing knock like that?",
